# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) for local development, and set the same
# variable in the Vercel project settings for the deployed site.
#
# Only the narrative stage uses this. The engine, the surveillance detectors
# and every number on the page are computed in C++ and WebAssembly and do not
# call out to anything. With this unset the site still works: the detections
# are complete, and the panel says plainly that the write-up stage is off.
#
# paste key here, do not commit it
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
